{"seq":10,"slug":"building-physics-environment","title":"建筑物理与建筑环境","stage":"DONE","category":"architecture-urban","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment","rating":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"建筑物理与建筑环境\">建筑物理与建筑环境</h1><p>走进一栋好建筑，你会觉得它&quot;不冷不热、不晃眼也不昏暗、安静、空气清新&quot;——这些感受没有一个来自结构是否安全，全部来自建筑物理。建筑物理研究的是人和建筑之间那层看不见的物理界面：热量怎样穿过墙体、阳光怎样进屋、声音怎样在房间里衰减、空气和水汽怎样在围护结构里迁移。它把&quot;舒适&quot;和&quot;节能&quot;这两个常被对立的目标，还原成可计算、可测量、可设计的物理量。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 用四条主线把建筑环境物理串起来，四条线不是并列罗列，而是层层递进，最终都指向同一个圆心：以人体舒适为目标、以能效为约束的可持续建筑。</p>\n<p>第一条线是热与能。它是全 hub 的物理底座。我们先讲热量如何通过导热、对流、辐射穿过围护结构，传热系数和热桥如何决定一栋楼的&quot;保温底子&quot;；再讲人体在什么热环境下才觉得舒适，PMV 与适应性模型如何量化这种主观感受；最后把得热与失热加总成建筑能量平衡，落到全年能耗与碳排放。热环境既是后面所有线的能量背景，也是节能设计的主战场。</p>\n<p>第二条线是光与视觉。阳光既带来照度也带来热量，所以光环境天然和热环境耦合。我们从天然采光的物理原理出发，讲清采光系数与窗墙比；再到电光源不足时如何做人工照明设计；最后处理光环境里最容易被忽视、却最影响体验的眩光与视觉舒适。</p>\n<p>第三条线是声。声音的传播规律和光、热完全不同，但设计逻辑相通：先建立室内声场与混响的基础物理，再讲如何把不想要的声音隔在外面（隔声与噪声控制），最后讲如何把想要的声音在厅堂里塑造得动听（厅堂声学设计）。</p>\n<p>第四条线是空气、湿度与前沿。它收束前三条线，又把视野推向未来。通风决定室内空气品质，也牵动热与能；湿度看不见，却在围护结构内部酿成结露、霉变、冻融等建筑病理；而所有这些物理过程，今天都被统一进建筑性能模拟与数字孪生的工作流里，让设计阶段就能预测建成后的真实表现。</p>\n<p>读完这个 hub，你会建立一种统一的视角：热、光、声、空气湿度不是四门彼此孤立的课，而是同一个&quot;人-建筑-气候&quot;系统在不同物理频段上的投影。每一篇文档都聚焦一个独有的概念深讲，遇到由别处主讲的概念则以一句话点到并交叉链接过去，让整个 hub 成为一张相互引用的知识网。</p>\n<p>建议按四章顺序通读：先打牢热与能的底座，再分别展开光、声两条感官主线，最后用空气湿度与数字化把全局收口。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"thermal-energy","title":"建筑热工与能耗","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/thermal-energy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"heat-transfer-and-envelope","title":"传热与建筑围护结构热工","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/thermal-energy/heat-transfer-and-envelope"},{"seq":2,"slug":"thermal-comfort","title":"热舒适","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/thermal-energy/thermal-comfort"},{"seq":3,"slug":"building-energy-balance","title":"建筑能量平衡与能耗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/thermal-energy/building-energy-balance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"light-and-vision","title":"光环境与视觉","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/light-and-vision","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"daylighting-principles","title":"天然采光原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/light-and-vision/daylighting-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"artificial-lighting-design","title":"人工照明设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/light-and-vision/artificial-lighting-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"glare-and-visual-comfort","title":"眩光与视觉舒适","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/light-and-vision/glare-and-visual-comfort"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"acoustics","title":"建筑声学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/acoustics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"room-acoustics-fundamentals","title":"室内声学基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/acoustics/room-acoustics-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sound-insulation-noise-control","title":"隔声与噪声控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/acoustics/sound-insulation-noise-control"},{"seq":3,"slug":"architectural-acoustics-design","title":"建筑声学设计（厅堂）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/acoustics/architectural-acoustics-design"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"air-moisture-frontiers","title":"空气、湿度与前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/air-moisture-frontiers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ventilation-indoor-air-quality","title":"通风与室内空气品质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/air-moisture-frontiers/ventilation-indoor-air-quality"},{"seq":2,"slug":"moisture-and-building-pathology","title":"湿度与建筑病理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/air-moisture-frontiers/moisture-and-building-pathology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-simulation-digital","title":"建筑性能模拟与数字化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/building-physics-environment/air-moisture-frontiers/performance-simulation-digital"}]}]}